      "title": "Manage - Resource accounts for voice applications",
      "section": "Next steps",
      "chars": 287,
      "preview": "Once you complete the resource account setup and assign a phone number if needed, you're ready to use the resource account with an auto attendant or call queue.\n\nYou can edit the resource account Display name and Resource account type using the Edit option. Select Save when you're done."
    },
    {
      "title": "How to create and configure resource accounts for Teams Rooms and panels",
      "section": "Next steps",
      "chars": 4449,
      "preview": "### Teams policies\n\nYou may need to apply custom bandwidth or meeting policies to this account. For more information, see Meeting policy settings for audio & video (/en-us/microsoftteams/meeting-policies-audio-and-video). For Teams Rooms, we recommend you set the bandwidth policy no lower than 10 Mbps.\n\nFor collaboration purposes, turn on PowerPoint Live, Whiteboard, and shared notes. We recommend"
    },
    {
      "title": "Restrict discovery of SharePoint sites and content - SharePoint in Microsoft 365",
